Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Form bounded sandbox probes using approved capabilities and representative inputs. Record environment and release identity, compare observed outcomes with the documented promise, and avoid treating one failed environment as proof of a product defect.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
